    'Inhbb encodes inhibin beta B, enabling activin B and inhibin B dimers with roles in reproduction and metabolic stress. Phenotypes differ from Inhba loss, so model choice should follow which activin species your assay actually measures. Conditional gonadal or metabolic tissue deletion prevents developmental confounders while preserving adult endpoints. Double conditional designs with Inhba appear when total activin tone must be removed. Humanized Inhbb supports antibody programs aimed at activin B rather than activin A.',
